**Geometry:** lid_driven_cavity (2D), L=1m × W=1m
**Fluid:** air (ν=1.50e-05 m²/s, ρ=1.23 kg/m³)
**Re = 100** → laminar regime
**Solver:** buoyantSimpleFoam (steady, incompressible)
**Turbulence:** laminar — no turbulence model (laminar)
**Simulation score:** 0.82 (converged=True)
**Notes:** OK | Rayleigh-Bénard. buoyantSimpleFoam, gravity in -y direction.

